    <p style="font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-style:italic">⚠️ All figures are estimates based on $166.76 CPM × planned impressions. Actual per-asset delivery determined by EQ5 platform optimization.</p>
    <p style="font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;font-style:italic">* April 2026 reflects a partial month only — all always-on assets launch April 15. Full run rate of ~$56,993/month begins May 1, 2026.</p>
